<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Burns Philp half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Burns Philp half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    63.7 vs  62.7</p>
<p>    Net				     48.2 vs  41.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     4.0  vs 8.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Burns Philp and Co Ltd is a food group.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		     1.04 vs  1.09</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.2 vs  8.1</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		profit 0.8 vs loss 7.6</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date March 26</p>
<p>Reg date March 5</p>
<p>    Tax				     12.0 vs  10.5</p>
<p>    Interest				39.8 vs  45.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  36.0 vs  34.7</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
